#: ccbot/watcher.py:147
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Claude Code is closing this session and asks about {count} unsent "
"feedback draft for Anthropic (they are written during the session and "
"kept in ~/.claude/feedback/drafts). It exits after the answer; in a "
"restart the session then comes back by itself."
